From 9f96dacd31329357ca8afd0df6817c1376cc9727 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 02:27:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rename Cloud VPN to Cloud VPS and add UpCloud server
 management

Cloud VPS now lists popular cloud providers (AWS, Azure, Linode, UpCloud,
Kamatera) and lets users connect an UpCloud account (API sub-account
username/password) to manage servers straight from the bot: list, create
(zone/plan/OS wizard with a cost-confirmation screen), view detail,
start/stop/restart, and delete (with an irreversible-action confirmation).
Other providers are shown as "coming soon" for now.

